Package: rcodeagent
Title: Coding Assistant for 'RStudio' with 'ChatGPT' Authentication
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person('José', 'Gamarra-Moncayo', role = c('aut', 'cre'),
    email = 'gamarramoncayoj@gmail.com')
Description: Provides an interactive coding assistant in the 'RStudio' Viewer
    to explain R code, draft scripts, and propose changes to a selected editor
    target. Supports read-only chat, explicitly authorized edits, and
    user-requested submission of code to the native R console. Authenticates
    through 'ChatGPT' using browser-based OAuth 2.0 authorization with Proof
    Key for Code Exchange (PKCE) and stores credentials using the operating
    system credential store. Model requests
    require Internet access and an eligible 'ChatGPT' Plus or Pro account under
    the service's current terms <https://developers.openai.com/siwc/quickstart>.
    Neither an API key nor 'Codex CLI' is required.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
SystemRequirements: RStudio Desktop (interactive use), web browser, Internet
    access, operating system credential store, eligible ChatGPT Plus or Pro
    account (model requests), Cairo support (PDF export), XQuartz (macOS PDF export)
